[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0010","text":"咲耶～\n有什么好玩的事吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0020","text":"哦呀？这可不行\n让公主殿下感到无聊了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0030","text":"是让我无聊了哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0040","text":"想为你提供些什么\n可惜手边没有可以送你的花束呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0050","text":"那个倒是无所谓啦——\n雾子有没有什么好玩的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0060","text":"我……\n能和摩美美酱……还有咲耶小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0070","text":"在一起……\n光是那样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0080","text":"就算什么都没有也很特别……是这个意思吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0090","text":"那今天就叫『无中生有的纪念日』，\n去吃点好吃的东西吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30800500_03_0100","text":"呵呵……\n新的……纪念日……"}]
